        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In the early history of mankind Santa was spreading happiness and joy for all for free.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>But naughty people grow jealous of Santa and they founded a Naughty Cabal.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>So Santa was capture together with many Elf's and locked away deep underground.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Elf Liberation Army, ELA, have now rescued Santa and he will now have to save the missing Elf's and the world from the Naughty Cabal!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212400/extras/8b3a81dbe16fe72b5c071dba3dc497b7.poster.avif?t=1765892738\" width=720 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212400/extras/8b3a81dbe16fe72b5c071dba3dc497b7.webm?t=1765892738\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212400/extras/8b3a81dbe16fe72b5c071dba3dc497b7.mp4?t=1765892738\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212400/extras/b2c23d32a1290cda3e60e3995f32ad36.avif?t=1765892738\" width=1560 height=444 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fight is done with <strong>Coal</strong>, <strong>Gingerbread Stars</strong>, <strong>Candy canes</strong>, <strong>Walnuts</strong> and <strong>Gift boxes</strong> as Santa would never use normal human weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212400/extras/df7865795af3b646bec23dced9703853.avif?t=1765892738\" width=1560 height=269 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And of course you need to eat <strong>Julgröt</strong>, <strong>Porridge</strong>, to get you health back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dashing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To help Santa staying alive you need to use the <strong>Dash</strong> to be temporary invulnerable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212400/extras/59c20bc8ee9243841b37015b3cfe1eb1.poster.avif?t=1765892738\" width=720 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212400/extras/59c20bc8ee9243841b37015b3cfe1eb1.webm?t=1765892738\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212400/extras/59c20bc8ee9243841b37015b3cfe1eb1.mp4?t=1765892738\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Death Ray Lasers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212400/extras/d93dc0466d0b8e211c29edf495214836.avif?t=1765892738\" width=700 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dashing</strong> is also useful to get pass <strong>Death Ray</strong> lasers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212400/extras/d0731a218be013c2320885fc81c8f381.avif?t=1765892738\" width=700 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But do not try to <strong>dash</strong> through the more powerful <strong>Death Ray 2000</strong> as that will end bad. The only way pass them is to disable them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212400/extras/8a509ffa063c48e6fc0b5395bcd7a83b.poster.avif?t=1765892738\" width=720 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212400/extras/8a509ffa063c48e6fc0b5395bcd7a83b.webm?t=1765892738\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212400/extras/8a509ffa063c48e6fc0b5395bcd7a83b.mp4?t=1765892738\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Total prop destruction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212400/extras/93fdfa263847586d189a839dadc105cd.poster.avif?t=1765892738\" width=720 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212400/extras/93fdfa263847586d189a839dadc105cd.webm?t=1765892738\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212400/extras/93fdfa263847586d189a839dadc105cd.mp4?t=1765892738\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
